						 <blockquote> <p>&quot;Mall Wart,&quot; Spanko intoned grimly, &quot;Mine ancient apiary.&quot;</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>A bastion of dark power it was, filled with every manner of thing that could be wanted, all at reasonable prices. He alighted on a high plastic sign bearing the number 4.</p> </blockquote> <p>This tale is hilarious. It's also the first depiction of Spanko speech that I don't find annoying.</p> 
